        "text": "{\"recorded_count\": 16, \"total_count\": 16, \"missing_ids\": [], \"complete\": true, \"results\": [{\"item_id\": \"FT-1\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Restaurant list shows 6 restaurants w/ cuisine and price ($$). Detail page for The Golden Fork shows cuisine \\\"French\\\", price \\\"$$$$\\\", address, description, amenities, and reviews.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-2\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typed \\\"Sakura\\\" in search box; list filtered live from 6 restaurants to 1 matching \\\"Sakura Garden\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-3\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Selected date Sep 4 2026, time 19:00, party size 6, filled contact info, applied coupon, clicked Confirm Reservation -> \\\"Reservation Confirmed!\\\" toast and confirmation screen shown; reservation appears in My Reservations upcoming list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-4\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"My Reservations page shows \\\"Upcoming (1)\\\" tab with the created reservation, including Modify and Cancel buttons. Modify tested successfully in FT-8.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitted a review (4 stars, name, date, text) via \\\"Write a Review\\\" tab on Sakura Garden; toast \\\"Review Submitted!\\\" appeared, review count went from 1 to 2, and the new review displayed correctly under \\\"Reviews\\\" tab linked to the restaurant with correct name/date/text/rating.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Entered GROUP15 coupon code for 6-guest party, applied successfully with toast \\\"15% off for parties of 6 or more\\\"; coupon shown as \\\"GROUP15 - 15% off\\\" in form and \\\"Coupon applied: GROUP15\\\" in reservation record.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Date picker calendar disables all past dates and today's date (Sep 2, 2026) as unselectable gridcells; only future dates (Sep 3 onward) are clickable, preventing booking of past dates/times.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Modify dialog allowed changing time 19:00->20:00 and party size 6->4; after Save Changes, toast \\\"Reservation Updated\\\" appeared and reservation list reflected new time (20:00) and new party size (4 Guests) accurately, other fields (date, restaurant) unchanged.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clearing the search box (empty content) does not trigger a filtered/invalid \\\"search\\\" result; it simply reverts to the default full restaurant browse listing (6 restaurants). No dedicated \\\"search\\\" submit action exists that could be executed with empty content.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Duplicate review not blocked\", \"actual\": \"Submitted a second review for the same restaurant using the identical reviewer name and date of visit as a review just submitted moments before. The system accepted it without any warning/blocking, incrementing review count from 2 to 3 (toast: \\\"Review Submitted!\\\"). There is no mechanism linking reviews to a specific completed order/reservation, so repeated reviews on the same order/visit are not prevented.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Coupon rule re-validation missing after reservation modification\", \"actual\": \"Applying GROUP15 to a 2-guest party correctly shows \\\"Coupon Not Applicable - This coupon requires a party of 6 or more\\\", and an invalid code shows \\\"Invalid Coupon\\\"; only one coupon can be applied at a time (new apply replaces old). However, when an existing reservation with GROUP15 (6-guest requirement) applied was modified via \\\"Modify\\\" to reduce party size to 4 guests, the system did NOT re-validate/remove the coupon: the reservation list continued to display \\\"Coupon applied: GROUP15\\\" for a 4-guest party, violating the \\\"must comply with applicable rules\\\" constraint.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Restaurant detail pages show no edit controls for price/hours/info (view-only: name, cuisine, price tier, address, description, amenities). Party size selector caps at 10 Guests, enforcing a maximum capacity limit per reservation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No real-time discounted price displayed\", \"actual\": \"Users can select date/time/party size and then apply a coupon, and clicking Confirm Reservation does validate info and return a booking result (toast + confirmation screen) - this part works. However, the system never displays any actual price or total anywhere in the reservation flow (before or after applying a coupon) - only a percentage badge like \\\"GROUP15 - 15% off\\\" is shown, with no dollar subtotal/discount/total. DOM scan confirmed no \\\"Total\\\"/\\\"Subtotal\\\" text and no numeric dollar amounts on the page. This does not satisfy \\\"the system will calculate the discounted price in real time.\\\"\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking Modify opened inline dialog to re-select time/party size and submit (tested in FT-8). Clicking Cancel opened alertdialog \\\"Cancel Reservation?\\\" with Keep/Cancel Reservation buttons; confirming cancellation showed toast \\\"Reservation Cancelled\\\" and moved item out of Upcoming list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No message center for historical notifications\", \"actual\": \"Pop-up toast notifications do appear in real time when booking status changes (e.g., \\\"Reservation Confirmed!\\\", \\\"Reservation Updated\\\", \\\"Reservation Cancelled\\\"), satisfying the real-time pop-up requirement. However, the app has no message/notification center anywhere in the UI (checked header/nav: only \\\"TableSpot\\\" logo, \\\"Restaurants\\\", \\\"My Reservations\\\" links, no bell/notifications icon or history page) to view historical notifications after the toast disappears.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No consolidated personal center with comment history\", \"actual\": \"The only account-like page is \\\"My Reservations\\\" (Upcoming/Past tabs), which shows completed/cancelled order (reservation) information. There is no section or page showing the user's own comment/review history (reviews they've submitted across restaurants) or \\\"applications\\\" (e.g., coupon usage history) - reviews are only viewable per-restaurant on that restaurant's detail page, not aggregated in a personal center.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
